usage: run_text_type_probe.py [-h] [--example EXAMPLE] [--model MODEL]
                              [--future-horizon FUTURE_HORIZON]
                              [--output OUTPUT] [--pad] [--from-prediction]

MolmoMotion quickstart: predict a 3D point trajectory and render it as an MP4.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --example EXAMPLE     Sub-directory of examples/data/ to run on.
  --model MODEL
  --future-horizon FUTURE_HORIZON
  --output OUTPUT       Output MP4 path.
  --pad                 Extend the canvas (black border) so track that
                        projects off the frame stays visible.
  --from-prediction     Skip the model (no GPU needed); use the bundled
                        released-model prediction from predictions_h3.jsonl.
